OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow and Gatwick among
OL,4,Aairports hit by air traffic control
OL,5,Aproblems
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights from airports in the UK and
OL,8,FIreland are being heavily disrupted by
OL,9,Fa technical problem affecting the air
OL,10,Ftraffic control provider Nats.
OL,12,FHeathrow, Gatwick, Stansted, East
OL,13,FMidlands and Dublin are among those to
OL,14,Fwarn of potential delays.
OL,16,FAt Heathrow, departures were initially
OL,17,Fpaused around lunchtime. Traffic then
OL,18,Fresumed, before facing further
OL,19,Fdisruption in the afternoon. It is
OL,20,Funderstood that very few flights are
OL,21,Fcurrently taking off.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
